    {
      "id": "claim_57a596fc869a497b89c9034194d9bae0",
      "statement": "canon() and ALIASES spell synonyms one way before matching (machine learning→ml, artificial intelligence→ai, full stack→fullstack, etc.), unifying query and title tokens so disjoint spellings become one result set; canon is applied by signal_tokens, distinctive_tokens, and job_title.",
